        SUPERChem: A <span class="search-hit mathjax">Multimodal</span> Reasoning Benchmark in Chemistry
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+Z">Zehua Zhao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+Z">Zhixian Huang</a>, 
      
