    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        When Diffusion Breaks Constraints: Sequential Autoregressive Generation with RL and MCTS
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+Z">Zirui Zhao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Niu%2C+B">Boye Niu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Soh%2C+H">Harold Soh</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hsu%2C+D">David Hsu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lee%2C+W+S">Wee Sun Lee</a>
      
