        Med-CRAFT: An Information System for Explainable and Configurable Construction of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Multimodal</span> Medical QA Datasets
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+S">Shenxi Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+K">Kan Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+M">Mingyang Zhao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tian%2C+Y">Yuhang Tian</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+B">Bin Li</a>
      
